      "writtenOn": "2021-06-10T18:07:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should pick a different name than APDO - that is already a term in USB-PD, and it stands for \u0027Augmented Power Delivery Object\u0027, not \u0027Adaptive Power Delivery Object\u0027 as it is used here.\n\nIronically - this CL will pave the way to enabling APDOs I guess, which will make this doubly confusing.",
